video-shotcraft — Apache License 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/video-shotcraft
    Copyright the video-shotcraft authors

Vendored unmodified into video/src/shotcraft/, apart from a header on each
file naming its origin, and one rename described below:

    PageCam.tsx     2.5D camera over a full page capture
    Motion.tsx      easing table, segment primitive, design stage
    shake.ts        deterministic hand held noise
    physics.ts      velocity, follow through, damped settle

Upstream calls the last of those motion.ts, alongside a Motion.tsx. Two names
that differ only in case are fine on Linux and ambiguous on macOS, where the
import resolved to the wrong file and every easing came back undefined. It is
physics.ts here. Nothing inside any file changed.

Three shot recipes from the same project were implemented against our own
material rather than vendored. The implementations in video/src are ours:

    scanline-annotate-focus       ScanRead.tsx
    timeline-travel               Sweeper.tsx
    dashboard-glow-highlight-pill LedgerReview.tsx
    odometer-digit-roll           Outro.tsx

