--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Narration
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The voice is Charon, generated with Google Cloud Text to Speech (Chirp3 HD),
and the line boundaries are measured with Google Cloud Speech to Text.

video/speak.py can also drive ElevenLabs with PALINODE_TTS=elevenlabs. Their
free plan permits commercial use with attribution; nothing in this film is
currently voiced with it, so there is nothing here to attribute.

